{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/candace-aster-azizi-developments-al-furjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":427,"crm_id":"1711","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Candace Aster","slug":"candace-aster-azizi-developments-al-furjan","display_address":"Al Furjan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":1707960,"display_price":"1.70M","lattitude":25.026342,"longitude":55.1544738,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Candace Aster is a residential project by Azizi Developments in Al Furjan, Dubai. The development consists of elegantly designed <strong>studios and 1 -2 bedroom apartments</strong> and offers comfortable living with a wide range of amenities, 24-hour concierge and luxurious living environment. It offers residents fully furnished apartments using high quality materials, exquisite amenities and European bathroom fixtures from the world's leading manufacturers. To create a comfortable atmosphere, residents are provided with a variety of amenities, including residence maintenance, housekeeping, laundry, valet parking service and childcare. Residents also have access to daily luxury amenities including a swimming pool, gym, spa, and outdoor Jacuzzi. There is a secure playground for children. One designated parking space is provided for each residential unit at the basement level.</p><p>The complex is located close to Sheikh Mohammed Ben Zayed Street, which leads to the emirate's famous developments.</p><p>Al Furjan Pavilion and Al Furjan West Pavilion, two community centers in the area, offer a wide range of amenities such as retail stores, restaurants, sports facilities, swimming pools, cafes and more.</p><p>The on-site Candace Restaurant expands the dining options. Just 20 minutes' drive to Al Maktoum International Airport, 35 minutes' drive to Dubai International Airport.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1711/images/2024/04/24/FHQTTh9jfvRg4deIiMVooDxBqO4ndaywi8h3PCTH.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/FHQTTh9jfvRg4deIiMVooDxBqO4ndaywi8h3PCTH.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1711/images/2024/04/24/J0YYOj2DYEUjPCZprk0ijWwP5nKsrpfFHCNiB1mc.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/J0YYOj2DYEUjPCZprk0ijWwP5nKsrpfFHCNiB1mc.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1711/images/2024/04/24/qol7HjpB4sXcxAUoWcyB2dmS6qEn37poJSauJ5YX.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/qol7HjpB4sXcxAUoWcyB2dmS6qEn37poJSauJ5YX.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1711/images/2024/04/24/hD8pzeWxfA4OiNuheuXiK2fkcsIxmrSlWfI7lgCh.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/hD8pzeWxfA4OiNuheuXiK2fkcsIxmrSlWfI7lgCh.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1711/images/2024/04/24/MMa6ZPVF6RhmxtIAItp8Pmme2rvyzt2cHO8M5VEe.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/MMa6ZPVF6RhmxtIAItp8Pmme2rvyzt2cHO8M5VEe.png","__ggfxIndex":4}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2098,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1345,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":6689,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":6690,"title":"80%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Al Furjan","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":11604,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11605,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11606,"url":